WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.250 --> 00:00:02.833
Everything they teach you
in school is a lie.

00:00:02.917 --> 00:00:03.750
You want the truth?

00:00:03.833 --> 00:00:07.542
The world is controlled
by shadowy elites

00:00:07.625 --> 00:00:09.917
and shapeshifting
lizard people.

00:00:10.500 --> 00:00:12.083
Let's talk about reptoids.

00:00:12.167 --> 00:00:14.167
Be sure to follow
these do's and don'ts

00:00:14.250 --> 00:00:16.208
to avoid
a diplomatic incident.

00:00:16.792 --> 00:00:18.333
Do offer them a cricket,

00:00:18.417 --> 00:00:20.625
mouse or vole
out of your pocket.

00:00:20.708 --> 00:00:22.375
Fun fact about voles,

00:00:22.458 --> 00:00:23.833
a vole ate my father.

00:00:25.000 --> 00:00:27.375
Don't use loaded
phrases like

00:00:27.458 --> 00:00:28.500
"Hissy fit"

00:00:28.583 --> 00:00:30.583
or
"See you later, alligator."

00:00:30.667 --> 00:00:32.583
Got it, be respectful.

00:00:32.667 --> 00:00:34.000
So, when do we talk about
the orgies?

00:00:34.083 --> 00:00:35.625
-Boo!
-Oh, come on!

00:00:35.708 --> 00:00:38.542
What? Everyone knows
reptoids have orgies.

00:00:38.625 --> 00:00:40.417
This is an HR meeting.

00:00:40.500 --> 00:00:43.333
Andre, Myc, shut the hell
up or I will castrate you.

00:00:43.417 --> 00:00:44.750
Ha! Good luck figuring out

00:00:44.833 --> 00:00:46.917
which one of my tentacles
is a dick.

00:00:48.250 --> 00:00:51.417
Tick question.
It's all of them.

00:00:52.875 --> 00:00:55.125
I'm deciding, this is ok.

00:01:00.083 --> 00:01:01.792
Oh god, this is an orgy,
isn't it?

00:01:01.875 --> 00:01:03.750
Oh yes, yes it is.

00:01:03.833 --> 00:01:06.500
Gavel, give me the gavel.

00:01:06.583 --> 00:01:07.708
Give me the gavel!

00:01:08.667 --> 00:01:10.375
This is it. It's happening.

00:01:10.458 --> 00:01:15.208
Hello HR, who's ready for
some gross misconduct?

00:01:15.917 --> 00:01:16.750
I'm sorry sir,

00:01:16.833 --> 00:01:19.208
but you tested
positive for iguanarrhea.

00:01:19.292 --> 00:01:20.417
Motherfucker!

00:01:20.500 --> 00:01:21.333
I wasn't done.

00:01:21.417 --> 00:01:25.500
Iguanarrhea, clawmydia,
sssyphilis, scalebies,

00:01:25.583 --> 00:01:27.708
explosive cloaca disease,

00:01:27.792 --> 00:01:29.042
oh yeah,
and mushroom herpes.

00:01:29.125 --> 00:01:30.208
Wait,
what was that last one?

00:01:30.833 --> 00:01:32.792
Reagan, you're the life
of this party.

00:01:32.875 --> 00:01:34.958
That's the most natural
smile I've ever seen

00:01:35.042 --> 00:01:36.083
out of Mark Zuckerberg.

00:01:39.375 --> 00:01:40.458
So, the song Shake It Off,

00:01:40.542 --> 00:01:42.708
was about how I shed my skin
ever 1,000 years,

00:01:42.792 --> 00:01:45.125
and the song Bad Blood
was about how I drink blood

00:01:45.208 --> 00:01:46.125
out of my Grammys.

00:01:47.417 --> 00:01:49.542
A toast to blood.

00:01:49.625 --> 00:01:51.083
Safe some blood
for Paul Rudd

00:01:53.083 --> 00:01:55.583
I gave you my kidney.

00:01:55.667 --> 00:01:57.458
And it was delicious.

00:01:57.542 --> 00:02:00.458
Reagan, meet my favourite
reptoidsentatives,

00:02:00.542 --> 00:02:03.083
Barb Shrike
and Zarthax Griswold Walton

00:02:03.167 --> 00:02:04.958
of the Reptoid High Council.

00:02:05.042 --> 00:02:07.333
Good evening,
Your Lizardness.

00:02:07.417 --> 00:02:09.292
Oh, we're not
that important.

00:02:09.375 --> 00:02:11.875
It's not like
we control the world.

00:02:11.958 --> 00:02:15.458
All rise,
for the reptilian anthem.

00:02:28.333 --> 00:02:30.083
Let's get down to lizness.

00:02:30.167 --> 00:02:32.333
We reptoids
have had a great decade.

00:02:32.417 --> 00:02:34.500
Thanks to propaganda
in the media,

00:02:34.583 --> 00:02:37.708
we have made society
more tolerant of our kind,

00:02:37.792 --> 00:02:40.167
from the Geico Gecko
to The Shape of Water.

00:02:41.167 --> 00:02:44.250
We even got K. Rool
in Smash!

00:02:44.333 --> 00:02:45.417
We did it, everyone!

00:02:45.500 --> 00:02:47.458
The world temperature
is rising.

00:02:47.542 --> 00:02:49.167
The time is coming brethren.

00:02:49.250 --> 00:02:51.458
Soon we shall
fulfil the prophecy,

00:02:51.542 --> 00:02:53.083
